{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"44f8fa4b2b3b841445404a5efea301d224551cfa1b32f3e7ecac47b6903cb953","ja":"今日の3人のお仕事は、カラオケ店のCM撮影！","zh":"今天3人的工作，是去拍卡拉OK店的广告！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5109e3a8a38f20f6b0857355fb70409faa60e477c904e4df81352ce884688a99","ja":"短期特番での、友達との仲の良さが話題となり、\nオファーされたもので……","zh":"因为在短期特别节目中和朋友展现出的好交情引起了热议，\n才接到了这次的邀约……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"224edecc651d5dbfc7c81a180abbe6c4426ebf96043ad61f599dab00bba03a13","ja":"「自由に、わいわいカラオケを楽しむ画が欲しいので、\n今日は青春っぽさ全開でお願いします！」","zh":"“想要一些自由自在、热热闹闹享受卡拉OK的画面，\n所以今天拜托大家全方位展现出青春的感觉！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ff191d2fc2d4f426a7c5412a0fcfd612082cbd6fbb27d48f04fbb22369f75145","ja":"「最初は私服で普通に楽しんでいただいて、\n盛り上がってきたら衣装で本番としましょう！」","zh":"“一开始先穿便服普普通通地享受，\n气氛热烈起来后再换上演出服正式登台吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"28e597c98ee64a5325e31d000f8524fd27f30fe40821a9c520693f8fd2065910","ja":"はい！　自由に、青春っぽく……ええと、\nいつも友達と歌っている感じでいいのかな？","zh":"好的！自由地、充满青春气息地……那个，\n就像平时和朋友一起唱歌那样就可以了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d2e9250e84d36ee3f9ece9a741af98b0e87ad837f64ccfbf8ac69a46275df72f","ja":"プライベートでもキュートな茜ちゃんを、\nた～っぷり見せちゃうチャンスだね♪","zh":"这是向大家充分展现小茜\n在私底下也超级可爱的好机会呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3ff04d29509d87fe151785ee6d9f5acee1ce3d9fbc9055eff484c93058abc354","ja":"にゃははっ、やる気いっぱいだね～！　そんじゃ、\nトップバッターは茜にお願いしちゃおっかな？","zh":"喵哈哈，干劲十足呢～！那先锋\n就拜托给茜吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"64de81fc6dcec2bfcb77be82d763b30ef656da6b1b24f9cf639d1eac73991377","ja":"オッケー！！\n今大人気のカワイイ曲、歌っちゃうよ～♪","zh":"好嘞！！\n这就来唱现在超有人气的可爱歌曲哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a2c4f7490dda572c37bfc40435f3d3cab010b969b07c3fa9c482419c71f47527","ja":"それじゃあアタシも、気になってる曲入れちゃお！　\nはい、紗代子もどんどん入れちゃってね！","zh":"那我我也来点一首自己在意的歌吧！\n来，纱代子也尽管多点几首哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"15f6af5b398f9d67deeeb1358db0a565a3a24da52424c12092e52b2a4cbb3ed0","ja":"うん！\nふふ、何を歌おうかな……♪","zh":"嗯！\n呵呵，唱什么好呢……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7eb46815cf043d6658225f49a2532aed004a04098c22358d17743f80d77870d3","ja":"歌が一巡するころには、すっかり盛り上がって……","zh":"等唱完一轮的时候，气氛已经完全热烈起来了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ecfc3db0b6b52f6924e080795d1abc8c5735236327d13aec0ac376228722178a","ja":"ねえ、3人でSNS用のショート動画も撮ろ♪\nカラオケで撮ってる子、結構多いみたいだし。","zh":"呐，我们也拍个3人一起发在社交平台上的短视频吧♪\n在KTV拍的人好像挺多的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9df6e3ecdf539ebbb109f7aa504625c1a6a9e0d983374eaaab61e410b3f009fa","ja":"うん！　どんな構図がいいかな？\n3人全員がよく見えるようなのって。","zh":"好！　构图该选什么样的好呢？\n像是能把3个人都拍得清清楚楚的那种。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"00c2f9f92a0acd644203c23bc5f5e56cd0e9a0251f179ce237940d6251491f49","ja":"SNSの動画を撮るなら、茜ちゃん、\nもう一回ヘアスタイル整えてもらおっかニャ～？","zh":"要是拍社交平台的视频，小茜，\n要不要再去整理一下发型喵～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d2a97a55e29c3f9e618ee83b364b14abce8760d7087564184b3a4c6b2ef8442b","ja":"にゃはは、いいじゃん、そのままで！\nじゃ、いくよ～。","zh":"喵哈哈，就这样挺好的嘛！\n那我来咯～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"973f6d7e4cf1ea2a99e2f78f4c7b72f3e817a35fea48b4630b77ff5b27d1bdd2","ja":"えっ、もう……！？　ええと、どうしたら……\nあ、メガネはずさなきゃ……！？","zh":"诶，已经……！？　那个，该怎么办才好……\n啊，得把眼镜摘下来才行……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1669.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"651c4a960f3402cef82615a929416c16cedb22c87b5b9641ef511b4c855c8c7a","ja":"ちょっと待っ……わぁっ！？　もう始まってるの！？\nみんなのアイドル、茜ちゃんで～す☆","zh":"等一下……哇啊！？已经开始了吗！？\n我是大家的偶像，小茜哦～☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
